{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son Courtney is a streamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to him, you're the most active moderator in his chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are always popping in and leaving rude messages. As his doting father, your role is to protect him from their vitriol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/68db42153f26c62afbc7e9fa016e0b44.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See a rude message in chat? Delete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone asked something creepy? EZ ban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat is theorizing about his personal life? Blow them all up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, Courtney might read their messages...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wouldn't want that, would we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/e0718da8653f3c990e078b8320a4e01d.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"End of Summer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811040/4dd891d22edbd980cbc68dd6024f3882b884e759.jpg"},{"name":"Biggest Fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811040/747bf8834a9319a8f0cdacf01fea7be4343f8223.jpg"},{"name":"Finite Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811040/898e6a650b7cf5903e8fdac9ab31c2b31564caa2.jpg"},{"name